{"page":398,"width":1690,"height":2473,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"458","words":[{"text":"458","x":175,"y":142,"width":58,"height":27}]},{"text":"Chapter 10 가장 메모리","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":303,"y":144,"width":115,"height":27},{"text":"10","x":431,"y":146,"width":35,"height":22},{"text":"가장","x":494,"y":148,"width":41,"height":24},{"text":"메모리","x":544,"y":149,"width":60,"height":23}]},{"text":"의 페이징 행태에만 영향을 받는다. 그러나, 지역 교체 빙뻡에서는 잘 안 쓰는 페이지 프","words":[{"text":"의","x":305,"y":264,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"페이징","x":348,"y":265,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"행태에만","x":450,"y":267,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"영향을","x":579,"y":267,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"받는다.","x":676,"y":267,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"그러나,","x":784,"y":267,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"지역","x":893,"y":266,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"교체","x":963,"y":268,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"빙뻡에서는","x":1037,"y":267,"width":159,"height":35},{"text":"잘","x":1210,"y":267,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"안","x":1255,"y":268,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"쓰는","x":1301,"y":270,"width":68,"height":32},{"text":"페이지","x":1384,"y":270,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"프","x":1494,"y":274,"width":29,"height":25}]},{"text":"레임이 있더라도 그것을 그대로 당비할 수 있다. 일반적으로 전역 교체가 지역 교체 알","words":[{"text":"레임이","x":305,"y":322,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"있더라도","x":410,"y":322,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"그것을","x":540,"y":323,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"그대로","x":640,"y":323,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"당비할","x":741,"y":323,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":840,"y":324,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":885,"y":323,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"일반적으로","x":968,"y":324,"width":152,"height":34},{"text":"전역","x":1137,"y":323,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"교체가","x":1215,"y":325,"width":102,"height":34},{"text":"지역","x":1334,"y":326,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"교체","x":1413,"y":326,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"알","x":1494,"y":326,"width":30,"height":34}]},{"text":"고리즘보다 더 좋은 시스템 성능을 나타내며, 1T1과서 보다 많이 시용되는 방법이다.","words":[{"text":"고리즘보다","x":302,"y":379,"width":153,"height":34},{"text":"더","x":467,"y":379,"width":23,"height":35},{"text":"좋은","x":505,"y":381,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"시스템","x":576,"y":380,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"성능을","x":673,"y":380,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"나타내며,","x":770,"y":379,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"1T1과서","x":907,"y":380,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"보다","x":1009,"y":380,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"많이","x":1082,"y":380,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"시용되는","x":1158,"y":379,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"방법이다.","x":1304,"y":382,"width":140,"height":34}]},{"text":"다음으로 전역 페이지 교체 정책을 구현히는 데 시용할 수 있는 전략 중 하나에 초점","words":[{"text":"다음으로","x":360,"y":435,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"전역","x":492,"y":436,"width":53,"height":34},{"text":"페이지","x":560,"y":437,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"교체","x":657,"y":437,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"정책을","x":728,"y":437,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"구현히는","x":824,"y":437,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"데","x":956,"y":437,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"시용할","x":996,"y":436,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1100,"y":437,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"있는","x":1146,"y":436,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"전략","x":1224,"y":437,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"중","x":1301,"y":440,"width":34,"height":32},{"text":"하나에","x":1348,"y":438,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"초점","x":1459,"y":439,"width":60,"height":33}]},{"text":"을 맞춘다. 이 방법을 A卜\u0026하면 기용 프레임 리스트의 모든 메모리 요청을 충족할 수 있","words":[{"text":"을","x":301,"y":493,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"맞춘다.","x":344,"y":492,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":457,"y":492,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"방법을","x":498,"y":493,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"A卜\u0026하면","x":597,"y":493,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"기용","x":725,"y":493,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"프레임","x":795,"y":494,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"리스트의","x":898,"y":494,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"모든","x":1030,"y":495,"width":62,"height":32},{"text":"메모리","x":1106,"y":493,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"요청을","x":1216,"y":494,"width":102,"height":34},{"text":"충족할","x":1331,"y":494,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1444,"y":495,"width":33,"height":33},{"text":"있","x":1493,"y":496,"width":27,"height":33}]},{"text":"지만 리스트 항목의 개수가 0으로 떨어져야 페이지 교체를 시작히는 것이 아니라 특정","words":[{"text":"지만","x":302,"y":548,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"리스트","x":377,"y":549,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"항목의","x":479,"y":550,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"개수가","x":581,"y":550,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"0으로","x":678,"y":553,"width":76,"height":28},{"text":"떨어져야","x":770,"y":550,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"페이지","x":901,"y":551,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"교체를","x":1005,"y":551,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"시작히는","x":1113,"y":550,"width":131,"height":34},{"text":"것이","x":1261,"y":551,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"아니라","x":1343,"y":551,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"특정","x":1456,"y":553,"width":61,"height":34}]},{"text":"임계값 아래로 떨어지면 페이지 교체를 시작한다. 이 전략은 새로운 요청을 충족시기기","words":[{"text":"임계값","x":302,"y":605,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"아래로","x":404,"y":606,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"떨어지면","x":507,"y":607,"width":113,"height":34},{"text":"페이지","x":635,"y":607,"width":83,"height":35},{"text":"교체를","x":734,"y":608,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"시작한다.","x":835,"y":608,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":977,"y":608,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"전략은","x":1021,"y":608,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"새로운","x":1128,"y":608,"width":98,"height":33},{"text":"요청을","x":1240,"y":609,"width":102,"height":33},{"text":"충족시기기","x":1355,"y":608,"width":161,"height":36}]},{"text":"에 충분한 여유 메모리가 항상 님아 있도록 보장하려고 노력한다.","words":[{"text":"에","x":300,"y":662,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"충분한","x":341,"y":663,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"여유","x":443,"y":664,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"메모리가","x":512,"y":664,"width":116,"hei